    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Greenevers prides itself on small‑town values, guided growth, and preserving its historical, cultural, and natural heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofgreenevers.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town has no passport office, so residents rely on nearby Rose Hill Post Office and Thelma Dingus Bryant Library for services.",
